WEBVTT

00:02.210 --> 00:05.400
<i>I couldn't take my eyes off her sparkling hair.</i>

00:08.710 --> 00:11.450
<i>Her bored-looking ruby eyes.</i>

00:12.090 --> 00:14.120
<i>Her small, well-shaped nose.</i>

00:14.580 --> 00:16.390
<i>Her cherry blossom-colored lips.</i>

00:19.440 --> 00:22.700
<i>That moment, I realized...</i>

00:23.990 --> 00:25.160
<i>This girl...</i>

02:03.780 --> 02:05.760
I heard there's a new student 
transferring in today.

02:05.760 --> 02:08.080
Wow, in May? That doesn't happen often.

02:08.080 --> 02:09.260
I wonder what he's like!

02:09.260 --> 02:10.520
I hope he's good-looking.

02:10.520 --> 02:12.160
Here we go again.

02:12.160 --> 02:13.480
I mean, come on...

02:13.480 --> 02:15.560
You can come in when I call for you.

02:15.560 --> 02:17.210
There's nothing to worry about.

02:17.210 --> 02:19.390
I'm sure you'll fit in just fine.

02:19.390 --> 02:21.630
Thank you.

02:21.630 --> 02:22.540
Yup.

02:25.940 --> 02:27.520
All right, take your seats.

02:27.520 --> 02:28.800
Okay.

02:28.800 --> 02:33.380
As some of you may know, 
I'm going to introduce a new student.

02:33.380 --> 02:35.430
<i>Well, here we go.</i>

02:36.130 --> 02:38.280
All right, come in.

02:39.050 --> 02:40.540
Okay, here we go!

02:41.440 --> 02:43.500
Akutsu Masatora-kun.

02:43.500 --> 02:44.890
Sixteen years old.

02:47.160 --> 02:50.730
When he was young, 
he didn't like having a shaved head,

02:50.730 --> 02:55.450
so he tried to use his dad's hair growth tonic, 
but it was actually hair removal cream.

02:55.450 --> 02:57.260
By the time he realized, it was too late.

02:58.370 --> 03:01.450
I kind of know what it's like, too.

03:01.450 --> 03:04.320
Well, Akutsu, say hi to everyone.

03:04.320 --> 03:05.180
Right.

03:05.180 --> 03:06.710
Nice to meet you all.

03:07.280 --> 03:09.000
I'm Akutsu Masatora.

03:09.460 --> 03:11.480
My hobby is exploring pharmacies.

03:11.480 --> 03:13.760
My favorite word is...

03:13.760 --> 03:15.670
follicles.

03:16.170 --> 03:17.210
Please live!

03:17.210 --> 03:21.690
My life hasn't been very good so far.

03:21.690 --> 03:29.980
But I hope to make some good 
memories with all of you here.

03:29.980 --> 03:31.730
Let's all applaud him!

03:33.490 --> 03:35.430
Be strong!

03:35.430 --> 03:36.650
You got this!

03:37.240 --> 03:40.040
<i>How can they not see through such a stupid lie?</i>

03:40.040 --> 03:43.490
<i>Humans are so simple!</i>

03:43.490 --> 03:45.640
There's something on your head.

03:57.240 --> 03:58.630
Akutsu...

03:58.630 --> 04:01.000
You've got a full head of hair.

04:01.680 --> 04:04.030
Are you trying to insult me?

04:04.030 --> 04:05.930
It grew out just now!

04:05.930 --> 04:08.060
I shed all my old cells!

04:08.060 --> 04:08.860
Damn it!

04:08.860 --> 04:10.920
Why did have to grow out now?

04:10.920 --> 04:12.560
These freaking...

04:12.560 --> 04:15.060
follicles!

04:15.460 --> 04:18.270
Akutsu, what do you think you're doing?!

04:18.270 --> 04:19.840
Don't stop me, Sensei!

04:19.840 --> 04:21.580
Pull out my hair and put it under!

04:21.580 --> 04:23.570
Pull out my hair and...

04:23.940 --> 04:25.850
Well, there you have it.

04:25.850 --> 04:27.790
You all be good to him, all right?

04:27.790 --> 04:29.320
Okay.

04:29.320 --> 04:31.240
Your seat's over there.

04:31.240 --> 04:32.370
Okay.

04:33.430 --> 04:37.910
<i>I did as I was told, but maybe 
I should have been more careful.</i>

04:39.000 --> 04:43.010
<i>Eh, no one's suspicious of 
who I might really be just yet.</i>

04:52.520 --> 04:54.920
<i>She's so cute.</i>

04:54.920 --> 04:56.710
<i>And pretty.</i>

04:58.080 --> 05:00.410
<i>I never thought a human girl 
could be so pretty.</i>

05:05.030 --> 05:06.520
<i>What was that?!</i>

05:06.520 --> 05:08.950
<i>What is this bittersweet 
emotion filling my chest?</i>

05:08.950 --> 05:10.600
Akutsu, what is wrong with you?!

05:10.600 --> 05:18.110
What's happening to my body?!

05:13.930 --> 05:16.080
Akutsu! Akutsu!

05:16.950 --> 05:18.540
Akutsu!

05:20.840 --> 05:22.470
Should we talk to him?

05:21.750 --> 05:24.030
<i>What was that just now?</i>

05:24.030 --> 05:26.260
<i>I still feel lightheaded.</i>

05:26.870 --> 05:29.240
<i>She's so cute, though.</i>

05:29.240 --> 05:30.680
<i>So pure and lovely.</i>

05:30.680 --> 05:32.560
<i>So beautiful and perfect.</i>

05:32.560 --> 05:36.090
<i>My life would be so fulfilling if I had 
someone like her as my girlfriend.</i>

05:39.410 --> 05:41.440
It's really coming down all of a sudden.

05:41.860 --> 05:44.680
Wait, I'm not dressed yet!

05:46.690 --> 05:47.910
Yes!

05:52.980 --> 05:54.470
Akutsu-kun...

05:55.010 --> 05:56.470
I'm ready.

05:57.250 --> 05:58.110
<i>Right!</i>

05:58.110 --> 06:01.610
<i>Maybe I should ask her for </i>the thing<i>.</i>

06:01.610 --> 06:04.140
<i>Of course! What a good idea!</i>

06:04.140 --> 06:06.720
<i>I just need a way to bring it up.</i>

06:06.720 --> 06:09.630
<i>It'd probably creep her out 
if I asked her straight.</i>

06:09.630 --> 06:11.880
L-Lily-chan...

06:12.470 --> 06:15.000
A pleasant breeze passes through 
each day of this early spring.

06:15.000 --> 06:17.180
How, may I ask, are you doing?

06:17.180 --> 06:20.060
When I see you, yada yada yada...

06:20.060 --> 06:23.070
So, with that, I must ask you to go out with me!

06:23.340 --> 06:24.970
I'm sorry.

06:24.970 --> 06:26.400
So quick?!

06:26.400 --> 06:28.380
At least give it some more thought!

06:28.380 --> 06:30.160
I don't want to leave you waiting.

06:29.620 --> 06:31.820
I get that, but...

06:30.160 --> 06:31.820
He's at it again.

06:31.820 --> 06:34.250
Sorry he's so noisy, Akutsu-kun.

06:34.830 --> 06:36.700
No, I don't mind.

06:36.700 --> 06:37.930
Um...

06:37.930 --> 06:39.600
Tanigawa Yuya.

06:39.600 --> 06:40.710
Tanigawa is fine.

06:40.710 --> 06:42.750
Got it. Tanigawa.

06:42.750 --> 06:43.680
Nice to meet you.

06:43.680 --> 06:44.280
Yeah.

06:44.280 --> 06:45.150
Nice to meet you.

06:45.150 --> 06:46.760
So, who's he?

06:47.510 --> 06:49.480
I'll try again later.

06:49.480 --> 06:50.160
Sure.

06:50.160 --> 06:51.790
That's Hirota.

06:51.790 --> 06:54.030
He's always been a horndog.

06:54.030 --> 06:57.470
He goes around confessing 
to any cute girl he sees.

06:57.470 --> 06:59.880
Although it looks like he's 
hooked on her right now.

06:59.880 --> 07:01.260
Huh.

07:01.260 --> 07:03.360
Aw, man.

07:03.360 --> 07:05.270
I got rejected again.

07:05.980 --> 07:09.240
Hirota, I briefed Akutsu-kun 
about you already.

07:09.240 --> 07:10.570
Oh, thank you.

07:10.570 --> 07:12.270
I'm Hirota Kensaku.

07:12.270 --> 07:15.180
I've got lots to talk about, 
so let's go out into the hallway.

07:15.180 --> 07:16.240
Right.

07:16.640 --> 07:19.740
I was kinda shocked when you 
made your introduction, though.

07:19.740 --> 07:21.580
That was kind of an accident.

07:21.580 --> 07:23.120
I mean, you know...

07:23.120 --> 07:25.590
Anyway, we'll be good buddies.

07:25.590 --> 07:28.760
Let me know if you have any questions.

07:28.760 --> 07:29.940
Who's she?

07:31.280 --> 07:32.910
Amane Lily-chan?

07:32.910 --> 07:36.110
She transferred in a little bit 
before you did, Akkun.

07:36.110 --> 07:38.680
She's a half and a kikokushijo.

07:40.820 --> 07:42.320
Let's go to the music room.

07:42.320 --> 07:43.130
Okay.

07:43.130 --> 07:45.270
We have piano tests today, don't we?

07:45.900 --> 07:47.050
Huh.

07:47.050 --> 07:49.610
A half and a kikokushijo...

07:49.610 --> 07:50.740
<i>What's that mean?</i>

07:50.740 --> 07:57.340
She's so short and adorable, but she's also 
really smart and has a good personality.

07:50.740 --> 07:58.620
<b>Imagination</b>

07:57.340 --> 07:58.620
She's like, hmm...

07:58.620 --> 07:59.920
An angel, I guess?

07:59.920 --> 08:00.730
Angel?!

08:00.730 --> 08:01.550
What's wrong?

08:01.550 --> 08:03.440
No, it's nothing.

08:03.440 --> 08:07.310
Anyway, if you're going for 
Lily-chan, you'd better be ready.

08:07.310 --> 08:08.380
Ready?

08:09.650 --> 08:13.760
I've already been rejected five times.

08:13.880 --> 08:15.710
Please go out with me!

08:15.710 --> 08:16.680
I'm sorry.

08:16.800 --> 08:18.350
We can start as friends!

08:18.350 --> 08:19.060
Sorry.

08:19.180 --> 08:21.020
I'm begging you!

08:20.240 --> 08:21.020
Sorry.

08:21.470 --> 08:22.540
Um...

08:21.830 --> 08:22.540
S.

08:22.540 --> 08:24.190
One letter?!

08:24.190 --> 08:26.110
You never learn, do you?

08:26.110 --> 08:28.600
I thought today was the day!

08:29.800 --> 08:31.500
Lily-chan!

08:31.500 --> 08:34.320
All right, I'm gonna go confess one more time!

08:34.320 --> 08:37.180
Chill! She <i>just</i> turned you down!

08:37.180 --> 08:38.480
I have no such recollection!

08:38.480 --> 08:40.400
You should give up for the day!

08:40.400 --> 08:41.840
Let me go!

08:41.840 --> 08:44.010
No one can stop my libido!

08:44.010 --> 08:45.730
Libido?!

08:44.010 --> 08:47.120
<i>To think she can entrance humans so...</i>

08:45.730 --> 08:47.120
Passion, then, I guess?

08:47.120 --> 08:49.390
I'm pretty sure that's not quite it.

08:47.730 --> 08:50.150
<i>I was right in my evaluation of her.</i>

08:51.590 --> 08:53.510
Amane Lily...

08:55.080 --> 08:58.800
<i>Now, how do I get close to her?</i>

08:58.800 --> 09:01.350
<i>I should head home and strategize.</i>

09:01.350 --> 09:03.090
I'm sorry!

09:03.090 --> 09:04.730
Wait, Amane?

09:05.100 --> 09:06.120
Huh?

09:06.120 --> 09:07.650
Akutsu-kun?

09:07.650 --> 09:10.240
You popped out of nowhere. That scared me.

09:10.240 --> 09:12.060
What were you doing in there?

09:12.060 --> 09:14.480
I-I got a bit lost.

09:16.820 --> 09:19.700
<i>Wait, this might be an opportunity.</i>

09:21.200 --> 09:22.660
H-Hey...

09:23.730 --> 09:25.240
<i>What am I supposed to say?</i>

09:26.180 --> 09:28.830
<i>What's a good line?</i>

09:28.830 --> 09:30.680
A-Akutsu's the name.

09:30.680 --> 09:31.530
Nice to meet ya.

09:31.530 --> 09:33.550
<i>What was that?!</i>

09:34.550 --> 09:36.300
I know.

09:36.300 --> 09:38.300
You're funny, Akutsu-kun.

09:38.300 --> 09:40.920
I haven't introduced myself yet.

09:40.920 --> 09:42.440
I'm Amane Lily.

09:42.810 --> 09:43.970
Nice to meet you.

09:44.710 --> 09:46.200
Nice to meet you.

09:47.240 --> 09:49.730
What happened to your sleeve?

09:49.730 --> 09:51.200
Oh, this is...

09:51.200 --> 09:53.320
Is it from when I bumped into you?

09:53.320 --> 09:54.650
N-No, that wasn't...

09:54.650 --> 09:56.640
Sorry! Is there any way 
I can make it up to you?

09:56.640 --> 09:58.490
N-Never mind that.

09:59.490 --> 10:02.430
There must have been a reason 
we bumped into each other.

10:02.430 --> 10:05.400
Why don't we go have tea 
or something to commemorate?

10:06.000 --> 10:06.880
Yes!

10:06.880 --> 10:08.870
Y-Yes, if you wish.

10:09.730 --> 10:11.180
Say what?

10:12.130 --> 10:13.550
You, too?

10:13.550 --> 10:14.120
Yeah.

10:14.120 --> 10:16.760
My parents live overseas.

10:16.760 --> 10:19.930
It must be rough living 
on your own as a guy, though.

10:20.390 --> 10:22.100
It's not that bad.

10:22.100 --> 10:23.500
Are you sure?

10:23.500 --> 10:24.840
I'm sure!

10:24.840 --> 10:26.160
Are you doing your chores?

10:26.160 --> 10:27.920
I do the cleaning and everything.

10:27.920 --> 10:31.270
You might have to prove that to me sometime.

10:47.980 --> 10:48.860
Are they all right?

10:49.760 --> 10:50.960
What happened?

10:50.270 --> 10:51.320
Are they safe?

10:51.320 --> 10:52.490
What was that?

11:00.720 --> 11:02.070
Akutsu-kun?!

11:02.070 --> 11:05.600
S-Sorry I grabbed you like that.

11:05.600 --> 11:07.210
D-Don't worry about that!

11:07.210 --> 11:08.400
Are you all right?

11:08.400 --> 11:11.210
My body aches a little.

11:11.210 --> 11:13.520
What do you mean <i>a little</i>?!

11:14.480 --> 11:16.320
Akutsu-kun?

11:16.320 --> 11:17.400
<i>Shoot!</i>

11:19.530 --> 11:20.440
Hey, call an ambulance!

11:20.440 --> 11:21.640
Someone, come help!

11:21.960 --> 11:22.910
Can you move?

11:22.910 --> 11:24.450
Y-Yeah.

11:23.700 --> 11:24.450
Where's the ambulance?

11:24.450 --> 11:25.400
This way.

11:26.200 --> 11:27.210
Hey!

11:27.210 --> 11:27.850
Somebody!

11:27.850 --> 11:28.950
Stay calm!

11:32.280 --> 11:33.080
Here.

11:33.080 --> 11:34.430
Right.

11:34.430 --> 11:35.090
Thanks.

11:37.590 --> 11:39.560
Are you sure you're all right?

11:39.560 --> 11:41.320
You really don't need to go to the hospital?

11:41.320 --> 11:42.140
I'm fine.

11:42.140 --> 11:44.270
The pain's gone now.

11:44.270 --> 11:45.370
Yeah?

11:45.970 --> 11:49.610
Thanks... for saving me.

11:49.610 --> 11:51.320
Well.

11:51.720 --> 11:52.600
Of course.

11:53.570 --> 11:54.780
Sorry.

11:54.780 --> 11:56.860
It's nothing to apologize for.

11:57.990 --> 12:00.610
Hey, can I ask you something?

12:01.300 --> 12:04.280
What are you?

12:07.660 --> 12:08.880
<i>Shoot.</i>

12:08.880 --> 12:11.120
You were fine when you got hit by that truck.

12:11.120 --> 12:12.910
And your ears...

12:12.910 --> 12:15.560
This is a weird question, but...

12:15.560 --> 12:20.000
I'm just wondering if, 
by any chance, you might be...

12:20.000 --> 12:21.740
not human?

12:25.560 --> 12:26.940
<i>Shit!</i>

12:26.940 --> 12:28.780
<i>What a failure!</i>

12:28.780 --> 12:31.680
<i>How could I blow my cover so early?!</i>

12:31.680 --> 12:34.520
<i>No, I need to keep up the lie.</i>

12:35.040 --> 12:35.690
<i>Eh?</i>

12:36.260 --> 12:38.650
<i>She isn't reacting too negatively.</i>

12:38.650 --> 12:40.970
<i>Is she into occult stuff?</i>

12:40.970 --> 12:43.580
<i>All right, let's take a chance!</i>

12:45.640 --> 12:47.900
Please don't tell anyone.

12:47.900 --> 12:50.200
You're right. I'm not human.

12:50.200 --> 12:51.080
I'm...

12:52.490 --> 12:53.320
I'm...

12:59.890 --> 13:00.950
Actually..

13:02.160 --> 13:03.610
A demon.

13:04.170 --> 13:06.140
A demon?

13:06.140 --> 13:07.300
Yeah.

13:07.300 --> 13:10.030
I came to the human realm on business.

13:10.030 --> 13:10.890
Business?

13:13.990 --> 13:18.360
Our world, Hell, is in danger.

13:19.220 --> 13:23.260
We're in a power struggle with the angels.

13:23.260 --> 13:26.620
Soon enough, Hell could be destroyed.

13:27.160 --> 13:31.940
And yet, my compatriots are all slacking off.

13:32.760 --> 13:37.230
And so my superior wants to 
appoint a charismatic leader

13:37.230 --> 13:40.170
to motivate the people of Hell.

13:40.560 --> 13:44.600
I've been tasked with finding that person.

13:44.600 --> 13:46.720
And you've found that person?

13:46.720 --> 13:49.630
No. I've only just started searching.

13:49.630 --> 13:54.350
And I'm wondering if you, Amane, 
would be willing to help us.

13:56.890 --> 13:58.240
But...

13:58.240 --> 13:59.650
This is all so sudden.

14:00.360 --> 14:03.040
I won't force you to join us.

14:03.040 --> 14:06.810
If you could just come to Hell once in a while

14:06.810 --> 14:09.700
to boost our morale, 
until we find the right person...

14:10.950 --> 14:11.940
Please!

14:14.950 --> 14:16.120
So...

14:16.120 --> 14:20.630
I'm a bit shocked to learn demons are real.

14:21.250 --> 14:24.220
You're really not what I expected.

14:24.750 --> 14:27.000
You protected me from the truck.

14:27.860 --> 14:29.560
You're not pushy.

14:29.560 --> 14:31.260
And you're pretty kind.

14:31.260 --> 14:33.720
Th-That wasn't really...

14:35.140 --> 14:37.030
Now you're getting shy. So weird.

14:40.230 --> 14:42.120
Are you sure I'm what you want?

14:42.120 --> 14:44.740
I don't have anything special going for me.

14:45.190 --> 14:48.080
I'm not sure I can even be helpful to you.

14:48.080 --> 14:50.590
Th-That's not true!

14:50.590 --> 14:52.620
I need you to be the one.

14:52.620 --> 14:56.240
It has to be someone cute 
who everyone will like.

14:56.240 --> 14:59.100
Is it really all right, though?

14:59.790 --> 15:06.550
Are people on the other side 
not going to be fearful of me or hate me?

15:06.550 --> 15:08.970
I really think you'll be fine.

15:08.970 --> 15:09.880
Are you sure?

15:17.590 --> 15:19.860
Wh-What's going on?!

15:24.690 --> 15:26.860
You thought you could seduce me?

15:26.860 --> 15:30.030
What a foolish demon you are.

15:30.030 --> 15:32.350
Who are you?

15:32.350 --> 15:33.580
Me?

15:33.580 --> 15:36.730
I suppose you could call me...

15:44.560 --> 15:48.260
A servant of Heaven, perhaps?

15:52.310 --> 15:53.640
An angel?!

15:54.800 --> 15:56.960
I enjoy your reaction.

15:56.960 --> 16:00.360
To think you'd invite me to the demons' 
realm without realizing I'm an enemy...

16:00.360 --> 16:02.310
What a embarrassment!

16:02.310 --> 16:03.620
D-Darn you...

16:03.620 --> 16:05.650
Don't bother trying.

16:06.820 --> 16:10.110
I manifested that chain myself.

16:10.110 --> 16:14.160
As you can see, I have full control 
over its strength and length.

16:14.160 --> 16:15.760
Even its color.

16:15.760 --> 16:19.260
Not many angels are as talented as I.

16:19.260 --> 16:21.580
But why must you make me fight two in one day?

16:21.580 --> 16:23.420
What if working so hard kills me?

16:23.420 --> 16:24.630
I ought to poke your eyes out.

16:25.670 --> 16:27.030
Stop!

16:27.030 --> 16:27.840
Two?

16:28.390 --> 16:32.090
This isn't from when I bumped into you.

16:34.410 --> 16:39.260
I was taking down another before I met you.

16:40.200 --> 16:44.140
I'd let my guard down, 
thinking it was a mere beast-type.

16:44.520 --> 16:46.770
I lost my temper, and...

16:49.880 --> 16:51.520
I'm sorry!

16:51.520 --> 16:53.240
Wait, Amane?

16:53.600 --> 16:54.590
Huh?

16:54.590 --> 16:56.160
Akutsu-kun?

16:56.160 --> 16:58.540
You popped out of nowhere. That scared me.

16:58.540 --> 17:00.290
What were you doing in there?

17:04.820 --> 17:09.420
I humiliated him plenty 
before I exorcised him slowly.

17:09.840 --> 17:13.080
Now, how shall I exorcise <i>you</i>?

17:14.340 --> 17:17.430
I can't get upset about 
being erased by the enemy.

17:17.960 --> 17:20.220
I have the same intention as well, after all.

17:20.220 --> 17:22.510
Indeed, indeed.

17:22.510 --> 17:23.610
But...

17:24.280 --> 17:27.500
You humiliated one of mine!

17:27.500 --> 17:29.630
Your kind always do this!

17:29.630 --> 17:32.800
It's time you learned your place, 
you wretched angel!

17:36.090 --> 17:40.200
You'd best not underestimate demonkind!

17:42.740 --> 17:45.150
Oh, I'm scared.

17:45.150 --> 17:48.730
I never expected to meet a demon 
that could break through my chain barrier.

17:50.240 --> 17:52.750
I'm impressed.

17:52.750 --> 17:54.970
Shut it!

18:05.180 --> 18:06.100
<i>Shit!</i>

18:12.630 --> 18:14.400
<i>She's...</i>

18:16.790 --> 18:18.180
<i>strong.</i>

18:21.650 --> 18:24.970
You seem to be a cut above the typical demon.

18:24.970 --> 18:27.620
It's almost a shame that I have to erase you.

18:27.620 --> 18:28.920
<i>This is bad.</i>

18:28.920 --> 18:30.480
<i>This is bad, bad, bad, bad!</i>

18:30.480 --> 18:31.630
<i>She's going to erase me!</i>

18:31.630 --> 18:32.330
I know.

18:32.330 --> 18:34.060
How about this?

18:36.510 --> 18:39.120
I could erase you right now.

18:39.120 --> 18:44.140
But if you tell me 
about Hell's plans, I'll let you go.

18:44.140 --> 18:46.310
Why would I ever believe you?

18:47.120 --> 18:48.380
Really?

18:49.070 --> 18:50.300
In that case...

18:52.100 --> 18:53.200
<i>I...</i>

18:53.200 --> 18:54.360
<i>I still...</i>

18:54.360 --> 18:57.180
<i>I haven't accomplished anything on this side!</i>

19:06.070 --> 19:07.620
What did you just do to me?

19:07.620 --> 19:09.610
I called it off.

19:09.610 --> 19:10.880
I changed my mind.

19:10.880 --> 19:12.800
I won't erase you.

19:12.800 --> 19:13.390
What?

19:13.390 --> 19:15.840
I said I'm not exorcising you.

19:16.260 --> 19:17.600
For real?

19:17.600 --> 19:19.070
You're sparing me?

19:19.070 --> 19:20.460
Tut tut.

19:20.460 --> 19:22.010
That's not it.

19:22.330 --> 19:24.600
I'm going to take you under my supervision

19:24.600 --> 19:27.580
and have you help me with my work.

19:27.580 --> 19:29.020
What? Work?

19:29.020 --> 19:29.960
What are you talking about?

19:29.960 --> 19:33.160
Accept now, and you'll even get 
a special Amane-branded collar.

19:33.160 --> 19:34.250
Don't want one!

19:34.250 --> 19:37.280
Why do I have to help out my enemy, anyway?

19:37.280 --> 19:38.690
Because...

19:39.510 --> 19:42.920
I want to be with you, Akutsu-kun.

19:43.880 --> 19:45.870
Are you messing with me?!

19:45.870 --> 19:50.430
Jokes aside, you would be 
helping me with my goals.

19:50.430 --> 19:55.390
I can't give you all the details, 
but if you agree, I will free you.

19:55.390 --> 19:57.080
Alive, of course.

19:57.520 --> 19:59.000
I don't trust you.

19:59.000 --> 20:02.440
But we fundamentally do not lie.

20:02.440 --> 20:05.050
Whether you believe me is up to you.

20:05.050 --> 20:06.550
<i>And yet, she puts on a good-girl act.</i>

20:06.550 --> 20:08.040
What's your choice?

20:08.040 --> 20:10.180
Would you rather stay there forever?

20:10.180 --> 20:13.690
And would you like to be 
discovered by passersby,

20:10.640 --> 20:16.810
#Share

20:13.690 --> 20:16.810
and be known all over social media 
as the solo S&M boy?

20:16.810 --> 20:18.060
Well? Well?

20:17.250 --> 20:21.360
<i>I definitely can't trust her to free me.</i>

20:18.060 --> 20:19.680
Is that what you want?

20:19.680 --> 20:21.780
It's the ultimate dilemma!

20:21.360 --> 20:23.500
<i>But I don't have another choice.</i>

20:21.780 --> 20:24.630
I can't wait to see you make your choice!

20:23.500 --> 20:26.340
<i>Is it my priority to overcome this situation?</i>

20:26.840 --> 20:27.980
All right.

20:27.980 --> 20:29.080
I'll cooperate.

20:29.080 --> 20:31.150
Very well, very well.

20:31.150 --> 20:33.580
You're quick to understand.

20:33.580 --> 20:35.750
Hurry up and unchain me.

20:36.240 --> 20:38.720
I mean, unchain me, please.

20:38.720 --> 20:40.480
Don't be in such a hurry.

20:40.480 --> 20:44.890
Before I do, you will put on this collar to 
prove your servitude to me.

20:44.300 --> 20:46.760
Hot out 
of the 
oven

20:44.890 --> 20:46.760
That <i>actually</i> exists?

20:47.700 --> 20:49.710
Stop squirming, you!

20:49.710 --> 20:51.020
Hold still!

20:54.850 --> 20:57.730
You don't know when to give up.

20:57.730 --> 20:59.280
S-Spare me, please!

20:59.280 --> 21:00.480
Refused.

21:00.480 --> 21:01.150
Mercy!

21:01.150 --> 21:02.360
I have no such thing.

21:02.660 --> 21:05.200
I'm putting the collar on you.

21:05.200 --> 21:07.690
It's around your neck now.

21:07.690 --> 21:08.780
No! Please!

21:10.930 --> 21:13.770
I like the way you yelp.

21:13.770 --> 21:15.960
It makes this even better for me.

21:16.920 --> 21:19.420
Please stand by

21:17.310 --> 21:19.160
The belt's passed through the loop.

21:19.160 --> 21:21.050
Almost there!

21:21.050 --> 21:22.920
Please! It hurts!

21:22.920 --> 21:24.280
Take it!

21:24.280 --> 21:26.660
The stick goes through this hole, and...

21:27.120 --> 21:29.300
It's a bit tight.

21:32.140 --> 21:34.360
Time to use some force.

21:38.950 --> 21:41.760
<i>I'd made a terrible mistake.</i>

21:41.760 --> 21:45.720
<i>I thought my only error was 
in attempting to hire the enemy.</i>

21:45.720 --> 21:51.820
<i>But what Amane did to my body 
made me unable to return to Hell.</i>

22:03.440 --> 22:05.830
<i>I see no future for myself.</i>
